     <span class="wprm-dynamic-quantity">
      340
     </span>
     g dry ramen (or
     <span class="wprm-dynamic-quantity">
      4
     </span>
     portions of fresh ramen noodles)
    </span>
   </li>
  </ul>
 </div>
